Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.64,Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(528,98)}Life Do-Over Device
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.90,0:00:08.77,Default,,0,0,0,,My. What a smart young boy, little Toshio is!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.98,0:00:11.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I know how to write!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.53,0:00:13.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.78,0:00:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Only his name, though!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.62,0:00:23.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You really are smart!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.25,0:00:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so moved!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.92,0:00:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You only just turned four, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.38,0:00:30.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I know how to write in Kanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.05,0:00:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,'Tree cuukeech 'minuch 'ne equals two cuukeech.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.42,0:00:34.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, you know maths too!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.93,0:00:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's too easy!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.47,0:00:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Know what 13 plus 26 is?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.31,0:00:45.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I do. It's 39.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.27,0:00:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita, go play by yourself for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.36,0:00:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.48,0:00:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I know way more than he does, \Nbut mum never praises ME!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.32,0:00:56.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, sure. You're in 4th grade now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.45,0:00:59.53,Default,,0,0,0,,4 years old, 4th grade, who cares? It's all 4!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.33,0:01:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish I could be 4-year old again, \Nknowing what I know now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.06,0:01:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure. That's easy enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.50,0:01:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It is?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.88,0:01:11.55,Default,,0,0,0,,The "Life Do-Over Device"!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.96,0:01:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone has moments in their life that they wish they could do over.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.88,0:01:21.88,Default,,0,0,0,,This device lets you go back. \NYou can relive those moments differently.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.44,0:01:24.80,Default,,0,0,0,,While keeping my current \Nintellect and physical strength?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.80,0:01:28.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course! That way you won't make the same mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.31,0:01:30.19,Default,,0,0,0,,What age do you want to go back to?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.19,0:01:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,4!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.98,0:01:35.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Got'cha!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.38,0:01:38.99,Default,,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.98,0:01:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't need glasses. \NI'm 4 again!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.68,0:02:01.35,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this place?\NWhat was I doin' here, I wonder?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.82,0:02:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, this was the lumberyard.\NI remember now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.16,0:02:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I 'ched to play here all the time. It hasn't changed a bit!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.78,0:02:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What're ya doin' up dere, Nobita-{\i1}kun{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.52,0:02:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hide and seek ain't fun...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.07,0:02:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,If you 'dun look for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.04,0:02:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Giant, Suneo and Shizuka-{\i1}chan{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.44,0:02:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You're all so adorable!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.74,0:02:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't call me adorable!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.66,0:02:27.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I see. Giant was as violent as ever always.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.83,0:02:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop picking on the weak!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.52,0:02:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Being helped by a girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.88,0:02:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita's such a crybaby!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.44,0:02:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,They've been making fun of me even in the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.05,0:02:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Letz' play sumthin' more incheresting!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.76,0:02:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,How 'bout school?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.18,0:02:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be the teacher!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.30,0:02:43.47,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I'll be the teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.47,0:02:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,No, me.\NI know how to write!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.20,0:02:47.85,Default,,0,0,0,,So do I.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.85,0:02:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Me too!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.06,0:02:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,'Awright, let's all write our names!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.54,0:02:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.92,0:02:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.94,0:02:58.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Now me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.36,0:03:02.07,Default,,0,0,0,,How dirty your handwriting is!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.07,0:03:04.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, can you write in Kanji?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.03,0:03:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, I can!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.76,0:03:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobi-{\i1}chan{\i0}, you can write in Kanji?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.22,0:03:11.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.79,0:03:15.09,Default,,0,0,0,,He's lying. This is just scribbles.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.20,0:03:16.96,Default,,0,0,0,,But I wrote using real Kanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.30,0:03:19.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll ask a grown-up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.54,0:03:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,'Xcuse me, michter!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.84,0:03:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it, young girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.42,0:03:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Unbelievable! You really wrote these Kanji?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.93,0:03:28.85,Default,,0,0,0,,So it is the real Kanji?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.85,0:03:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What a refined handwriting!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.85,0:03:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't accept this!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.94,0:03:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That's cheating!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.32,0:03:38.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Take that!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.78,0:03:43.19,Default,,0,0,0,,What? My Nobi-{\i1}chan{\i0} made them cry?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.19,0:03:45.45,Default,,0,0,0,,But I just pushed them!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.28,0:03:49.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually I'm from the Genius' Education Society.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.37,0:03:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Genius' Education Society?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.87,0:03:55.67,Default,,0,0,0,,What? My Nobi-{\i1}chan{\i0} wrote this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.67,0:03:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I know how to write all kinds of words.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.14,0:03:59.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, here's the next problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.71,0:04:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I have 3 apples and 3 bananas. How many is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.18,0:04:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,6.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.36,0:04:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm surprised, this is quite an amazing feat for just a 4-year old boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.52,0:04:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I recommend sending him to an elementary school.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.14,0:04:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,He's as mature as an 2nd grader.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.23,0:04:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I'm actually 4th grader!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.90,0:04:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.98,0:04:22.03,Default,,0,0,0,,He passed every test with authority. He's a genius!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.03,0:04:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We are blessed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.32,0:04:26.03,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll be able to enter the Tokyo University like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.03,0:04:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Not just that, he'll be a great scholar.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.08,0:04:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,How wonderful!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.55,0:04:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,FoGonna take a leak?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.50,0:04:41.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.30,0:04:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,,A monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.14,0:04:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Shh! It's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.89,0:04:52.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like you had lot of fun. \NNow let's go home!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.43,0:04:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget it! Everyone's delighted having me here!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.44,0:04:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a genius here. They say I'm gonna eventually grow up to become the Prime Minister of Japan!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.36,0:05:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanna become a grown-up like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.90,0:05:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,No can do. You can't rely on my gadgets. \NYou need to grow up with your own efforts!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.16,0:05:07.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Says who?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.95,0:05:12.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Then see your future for yourself with the "Time TV".
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.00,0:05:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,This will show you what happens if you stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.08,0:05:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,FIrst, a year from now on!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.08,0:05:20.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone's getting their test papers back.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.63,0:05:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I got 100 points. Isn't that amazing?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.17,0:05:29.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's see you as a fourth grader.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.56,0:05:34.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.68,0:05:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you got another 0! \NYou need to study harder!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.40,0:05:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just about to.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.81,0:05:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.40,0:05:43.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember, you're still at a second grade level.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.61,0:05:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,But since you never study in this world...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.94,0:05:47.57,Default,,0,0,0,,...you have no idea how to actually do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.57,0:05:50.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's see you as an adult...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.41,0:05:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't wanna! Had enough! \NI'll go back!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.28,0:05:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Good boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.50,0:05:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I would like to go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.75,0:06:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you understand that the path\N to success is through hard work!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.84,0:06:12.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright! I'm gonna study!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.85,0:06:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Great!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.06,0:06:17.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna study hard and invent a device!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.31,0:06:18.39,Default,,0,0,0,,But what device?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.39,0:06:21.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll invent a device that makes \Nyou smart without studying!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.94,0:06:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,How hopeless! He still doesn't understand!
